# CULT-ULHU map file: dark_wilds — GENERATED, do not hand-edit
# Regenerate: python3 assets/world/generate_dark_wilds.py
#
# FORMAT: same as ruined_city.map (map/zone/place/lod/atmosphere), plus:
#   spawn <species> <x> <y> <z> <count> <zone>
#       Feral creature spawn entry. <species> must be a key of
#       ModelCatalog::creatureModels(). y is baked from the
#       height field at generation time.
#
# ART DIRECTION - the dark wilds beyond the ruined city.
#   Palette: ash greys on the highlands; basalt near-black in
#   the cavern; dusty bone stone in the razed city; dead moss
#   browns in the drywood; green-black murk in the swamp.
#   Night is the default. Stars die inside the cavern bowl.
#   Budget: host-simulated build — every prop < 2000 tris,
#   terrain is one 130k-tri static mesh (single draw call).
# ==========================================================

